From 536bdec066533776acbb8037792a3df9ed4bd7c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 17:52:49 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dicts: Rule Status group reads VPN; drop two
 Professional-page tokens no row uses

RFW_298 "VPN servers" -> "VPN" in every pack (the group also holds policy
routing and Killswitch rows; the word needs no translation). RWFP_24 and
RWFP_26 removed from all 25 packs; only the removed modulation and Bluetooth
rows referenced them. Lockstep 6987 -> 6985.
